From 2fd350a7721d8660e8a5b1d17567ecbcee247f57 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Aishwarya R <aisr@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 27 May 2025 17:36:10 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] UPSTREAM:DP:wifi:mac80211: Disable TID-level stats by
 default to reduce KPI overhead

TID-level statistics in mac80211 provide detailed per-TID packet and drop
counters, which are useful for debugging and performance analysis. However,
collecting these stats impacts KPI.

Disabled TID level stats by default and can be enabled through below debugfs
interface

echo 0 > kernel/debug/ath12k/qcn9274\ hw2.0_0000:01:00.0/tid_stats_disable

Patch-dependency: 945-wifi-mac80211-Enhance-TX-stats-reporting-per-TID-spe.patch
Signed-off-by: Aishwarya R <aisr@qti.qualcomm.com>
